sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Wallet
    participant Node
    participant Mempool
    participant Consensus
    participant Network
    participant Block

    User->>Wallet: Create transaction
    Wallet->>Wallet: Sign with BLS
    Wallet->>Node: Submit signed tx
    
    Node->>Node: Validate signature
    Node->>Mempool: Check nonce & balance
    
    alt Valid Transaction
        Mempool->>Network: Dandelion++ stem phase
        Network->>Network: 2-4 hops anonymization
        Network->>Mempool: Fluff phase broadcast
        
        Mempool->>Consensus: Include in DAG vertex
        Consensus->>Consensus: BLS aggregate signatures
        Consensus->>Consensus: HotStuff finality
        
        Consensus->>Block: Commit block
        Block->>Network: Propagate to peers
        Network->>Node: Receive block
        Node->>Wallet: Confirm inclusion
        Wallet->>User: Transaction confirmed
    else Invalid Transaction
        Node-->>Wallet: Reject with error
        Wallet-->>User: Show error
    end
EOF
